  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;be a sequence such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
